OL,3,GNEWSABlacksmithing returns to Gretna
OL,4,AGreen after 150 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FBlacksmithing has returned to
OL,7,FScotland's wedding capital for the
OL,8,Ffirst time in more than 150 years with
OL,9,Fthe opening of a new forge.
OL,11,FCouples have married at the anvil in
OL,12,FGretna Green for centuries, but the
OL,13,Ftraditional craft had disappeared from
OL,14,Fthe village.
OL,16,FThe new forge will offer visitors the
OL,17,Fchance to practise the skills involved
OL,18,Fand even allow newly-weds to create a
OL,19,Fkeepsake of their own.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,428,420,260,160,0,100
